        "subject": "LU-19179 llite: add back flock flag marco check",
        "message": "LU-19179 llite: add back flock flag marco check\n\nThis patch adds back flock flag marco check for F_SETLKW64,\nF_SETLK64 and F_GETLK64.\nOtherwise, it will cause build failure on some distros.\n\nFixes: c02c8c2132 (\"LU-19179 llite: remove kernel specific handling\")\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nChange-Id: I5fb56c8008b717243e86d33504be4692a9a983e6\nSigned-off-by: Yingjin Qian <qian@ddn.com>\n"
